{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A Dog Story&quot; is a story-rich exploration game about love, loss, and letting go \u2014 told through the eyes of a dog who doesn\u2019t know she has died.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870510/extras/af9b223a82001a1a6b1a17f32b9d8fc2.avif?t=1774091245\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Black, a small black mutt who wakes up at the bottom of a well in the middle of a storm. Confused and frightened, she claws her way back to the garden, eager to return to her family \u2014 only to find the house empty, her scent fading, and shadows moving through the rain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across six days and nights, Black roams the empty home and garden, searching for her boy. She watches over the house from unseen terrors, ventures into haunting dreamlike dungeons, and confronts grotesque ghostly creatures \u2014 all while holding on to the fading hope that life might still return to normal. But with each passing night, the world becomes more distorted, the memories more fractured \u2014 and something in the darkness is calling her back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870510/extras/04f88849420bcbebd1efef51e77d3663.avif?t=1774091245\" width=180 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just your average narrative adventure. Between chasing echoes in empty rooms and hiding from shadows that shouldn't exist, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that reveal hidden sides of your personality\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school turn-based dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre personality quizzes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot shiny stuff, equip questionable gear</strong>, and go toe-to-toe with a terrifying cast of shadowy spirit-things</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Climb out of the well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/b7675d8d2b3eed8e8a84b56d741fa11b35c38f48.jpg"},{"name":"The burned photograph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/b4b2ab4ee0134f5b0b2ce2a5791a1b136800b8d1.jpg"},{"name":"The second night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/91964e0faafabddb226b6f9c027c0b2dc53afcd5.jpg"},{"name":"A nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/ef06c26475b34fc8f9b1edb2fbece0e1e79e6134.jpg"},{"name":"On different sides","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/c91f74669b42f9ef6ba80bf87146589b0f7dc249.jpg"},{"name":"Of two worlds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870510/83914fa4bc6ed417d1bfd2b94cd6c5a02219fd0e.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870510?t=1774091245","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870510/93e6fae5480348da5d3a39cff736138e44b6953d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774091245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870510/6016a49a4fd2fcf5b3e1bf9ecb0e648b18ccef9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774091245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870510/6016a49a4fd2fcf5b3e1bf9ecb0e648b18ccef9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774091245","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"descr